{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, a bunch of grave robbers woke up the slumbering <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>... Maybe the world is gonna pay the price for <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>\u2019s bad mood after waking up...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/2e2e455c961184eca859e32f5d14cd88.poster.avif?t=1770114358\" width=718 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/2e2e455c961184eca859e32f5d14cd88.webm?t=1770114358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/2e2e455c961184eca859e32f5d14cd88.mp4?t=1770114358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deck-building strategy game. You\u2019ll take on the role of the awakened <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>, commanding an army of puppets and harvesting wandering souls as resources, to turn the entire world into your personal &quot;collection&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corpse Lady\u2019s Game Time</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game features 5 wildly distinct main story campaigns and 10 challenge levels. Difficulty scales with your progress through the main story, and every level has its own unique lore\u2014from the incompetent husband, the nine-tailed fox demon, to the otherworldly girl...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> to crush those mortal heroes who dare to resist. Trap their bodies and wills forever as worthless &quot;collectibles&quot; in <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>\u2019s treasure vault. These triumphs will be preserved as victory CGs, and you\u2019ll also unlock 6 distinct skins for <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/3eb29cb954bd0ab4fa966c9a24e86444.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/3eb29cb954bd0ab4fa966c9a24e86444.avif?t=1770114358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tipsy Dragon Maiden, Loyal Blade Spirit, Erotic Artist, Fallen Princess... Recruit a total of 28 followers with extraordinary abilities. Each one boasts a unique personality and a one-of-a-kind ultimate talent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/a93774f5f514b7e87c7be79f8af20385.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/a93774f5f514b7e87c7be79f8af20385.avif?t=1770114358 width=800 height=333 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting throughout the game! Headlined by voice actors Xu Hui\uff08Kafka from <i>Honkai: Star Rail \uff09</i>and Xie Ying(Ke Qing Genshin Impact), the entire cast nails the villainous vibe, breathing life into the game\u2019s iconic characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/6ec86cc84fb4d40911d803d7a1aa73e4.avif?t=1770114358\" width=1280 height=634 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarm the field or hold your ground\u2014fight and grow stronger. <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> can bestow blessings upon followers who shine in battle, boosting their base stats drastically and unlocking more powerful skill branches. Alternatively, you can summon an all-new unit to gain extra offensive opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/43ab091c366fd77029c501689dee9c9b.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/43ab091c366fd77029c501689dee9c9b.avif?t=1770114358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasure in the Dark Scripts: Every time <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> levels up, she grants followers a &quot;Dark Script&quot;. These scripts provide massive power boosts\u2014but beware, overwhelming strength always comes with a deadly curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/0f491e583a59ddf9c899354928702587.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/0f491e583a59ddf9c899354928702587.avif?t=1770114358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corpse Lady</strong>\u2019s Treasure Vault: Unlock over 100 magical artifacts to choose from, delivering devastating fire support to your followers. Some artifacts trigger exclusive effects when equipped by specific characters, awakening even more menacing abilities. Any excess loot can be smelted down for cold hard cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/03204ea7b6d191fb400735b07d57ad88.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/03204ea7b6d191fb400735b07d57ad88.avif?t=1770114358 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even death is trivial. Whenever a puppet falls in battle, as long as the game goes on, <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> can bring it back with a mere snap of her fingers\u2014even if the puppet itself has been &quot;dead&quot; for eons, heh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, all of this is nothing more than a little game for <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> to kill time with... after she woke up from her long slumber.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Smoking, drinking, getting a perm!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/d4957f4a57673442878ca51af9ca887677160998.jpg"},{"name":"Just kidding~","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/9dbb91d583d3e5f35cbe7d26fc382b193eefa58a.jpg"},{"name":"Old eyes are blurred","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/56487ea21ac8715a68489b673bddf2156599e80a.jpg"},{"name":"Just a bit of weathering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/e0c3fe46dd103cd118860f02de6af32926413f6b.jpg"},{"name":"Come on up, move yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/8341c5ddc68f19e627bb8ce383708607e4b2af68.jpg"},{"name":"PowerOverWhelming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/c85437601cecf7f81b3cc369110c6f0130f1b9c9.jpg"},{"name":"FireAway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/f5d3db10ab318a8a443e471c89d9b428dd75b1c8.jpg"},{"name":"One-Punch Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/c7f296f3d929c31d50b29d8cc49665dd851a51e6.jpg"},{"name":"Everything is nothing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/7c9bccda8b7e6e9372b4380d83339819636abbc2.jpg"},{"name":"Kakaa! Kakaa!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842800/907ae49f8f41d575f0698913fb8e893a957446cf.jpg"}],"total":49},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2842800?t=1770114358","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2842800?t=1770114358","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/9c70fb727feb43ac3d7aaa0774eb4d21d37a892d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770114358","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/9c70fb727feb43ac3d7aaa0774eb4d21d37a892d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770114358","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The excessively revealing attire of female characters featured within the game may not be suitable for audiences across all age demographics."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, a bunch of grave robbers woke up the slumbering <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>... Maybe the world is gonna pay the price for <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>\u2019s bad mood after waking up...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/2e2e455c961184eca859e32f5d14cd88.poster.avif?t=1770114358\" width=718 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/2e2e455c961184eca859e32f5d14cd88.webm?t=1770114358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/2e2e455c961184eca859e32f5d14cd88.mp4?t=1770114358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deck-building strategy game. You\u2019ll take on the role of the awakened <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>, commanding an army of puppets and harvesting wandering souls as resources, to turn the entire world into your personal &quot;collection&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corpse Lady\u2019s Game Time</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game features 5 wildly distinct main story campaigns and 10 challenge levels. Difficulty scales with your progress through the main story, and every level has its own unique lore\u2014from the incompetent husband, the nine-tailed fox demon, to the otherworldly girl...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> to crush those mortal heroes who dare to resist. Trap their bodies and wills forever as worthless &quot;collectibles&quot; in <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>\u2019s treasure vault. These triumphs will be preserved as victory CGs, and you\u2019ll also unlock 6 distinct skins for <strong>Corpse Lady</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/3eb29cb954bd0ab4fa966c9a24e86444.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/3eb29cb954bd0ab4fa966c9a24e86444.avif?t=1770114358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tipsy Dragon Maiden, Loyal Blade Spirit, Erotic Artist, Fallen Princess... Recruit a total of 28 followers with extraordinary abilities. Each one boasts a unique personality and a one-of-a-kind ultimate talent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/a93774f5f514b7e87c7be79f8af20385.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/a93774f5f514b7e87c7be79f8af20385.avif?t=1770114358 width=800 height=333 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting throughout the game! Headlined by voice actors Xu Hui\uff08Kafka from <i>Honkai: Star Rail \uff09</i>and Xie Ying(Ke Qing Genshin Impact), the entire cast nails the villainous vibe, breathing life into the game\u2019s iconic characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/6ec86cc84fb4d40911d803d7a1aa73e4.avif?t=1770114358\" width=1280 height=634 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarm the field or hold your ground\u2014fight and grow stronger. <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> can bestow blessings upon followers who shine in battle, boosting their base stats drastically and unlocking more powerful skill branches. Alternatively, you can summon an all-new unit to gain extra offensive opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/43ab091c366fd77029c501689dee9c9b.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/43ab091c366fd77029c501689dee9c9b.avif?t=1770114358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasure in the Dark Scripts: Every time <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> levels up, she grants followers a &quot;Dark Script&quot;. These scripts provide massive power boosts\u2014but beware, overwhelming strength always comes with a deadly curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/0f491e583a59ddf9c899354928702587.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/0f491e583a59ddf9c899354928702587.avif?t=1770114358 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corpse Lady</strong>\u2019s Treasure Vault: Unlock over 100 magical artifacts to choose from, delivering devastating fire support to your followers. Some artifacts trigger exclusive effects when equipped by specific characters, awakening even more menacing abilities. Any excess loot can be smelted down for cold hard cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras/03204ea7b6d191fb400735b07d57ad88.avif?t=1770114358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/extras_big/03204ea7b6d191fb400735b07d57ad88.avif?t=1770114358 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even death is trivial. Whenever a puppet falls in battle, as long as the game goes on, <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> can bring it back with a mere snap of her fingers\u2014even if the puppet itself has been &quot;dead&quot; for eons, heh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, all of this is nothing more than a little game for <strong>Corpse Lady</strong> to kill time with... after she woke up from her long slumber.</p></li></ul>","developers":["HT3 Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842800/f40e0723ef447af535605f1